      "message": "fix(setup): travel-limit test on its own short-stroke mill; MCP fixture findings name each setup's machine\n\nMain's #477 moved the built-in VMC Z stroke to program-coordinate bands,\nso the face no longer outran it. Setup1 now mounts an explicit\nshort-stroke mill. get_fixture_findings' workholding entries carry their\nown setup's machine; the top-level field stays the active one.\n\nRefs #388\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
